  "description": "DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Layout is the shared graph layout of the CanvasNet diagram packages: a port of graphlib and of the dagre layered layout of dagre-d3-es, which positions the nodes of a directed, possibly compound and cyclic graph in ranks and routes its edges, deterministically and within a work budget. It has no public API; it is installed as a dependency of DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid and DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.PlantUml. Not affiliated with the dagre, graphlib, dagre-d3-es or lodash projects.",
